Z||000000||Joe Torma||09-09-2001||06:12 PM||||I just took this one this morning.  Just wanted to share it...don't know why I like it so much.  The paint was no good from the start and have to sand the rest off.<P>I had just reprogrammed the TECII system(see my laptop on the roof   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) and it was running really decent.  This was much better than the night before.  Ugh!  What a mess<P>It hunts around for idle a little, but not too bad...I have enough variables to mess with to get it right--someday <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joescar9.jpg">   <P>I'll post my updates on the dash here later...didn't vinyl it yet, I have a new idea for it.<P><BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif">    <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
