Z||000002||Denny||09-09-2001||08:39 PM||||Hey Joe! Looking good! But, how come you didn't make it to Zinn's? I'd have rembered the car!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000003||Joe Torma||09-09-2001||08:59 PM||||Denny, I got stuck working because the other manager @ work got into a car accident.<P>That, and I took too many things off and apart(before he got hurt) that I couldn't put back on to be drivable while working a lot.  You don't know how badly I wanted to go.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Does MAFOA have meetings/cruise nights or any events coming up????  I'm hoping to drive my car this weekend!!!<P>Kwez, I have the 3400series GM 6cyl.  Roller, Gen III Aluminum heads, custom cam, ported & polished, other little things, home-made hedders.  I love the way it sounds!  That TECII is amazing.  Stock computer had crazy things like AbuseManagementControl and Speed limiter(85mph), can't have that now, can we? <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3400_1.gif">  <P>Tonight's project...sucked out all the moisture and tested the A/C for leaks.  None so far-- has held vaccuum for 2+ hours. I spliced the hoses last night...took me like 4 hours to route and push them on...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> what a pain.  Hope it holds!<p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000004||Denny||09-10-2001||07:23 AM||||How about joining us at the Keystone State Chapter POCI Fall meet at A.W. Golden Pontiac/GMC in Reading, PA?  It's on Sunday, September 23rd.<P>See the Calendar page at <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/</A>  for more info.<P>We have been the dominate model at these shows for the last 4 years.<P>I'll look for you there!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Till then I'm  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif">, especially since it's Monday morning!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Denny Lambert<BR>Custom 1986 SE<BR>Stock 1986 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SEGTfront.jpg"> ||||reg||6
